":"Still","s":284.51,"e":284.88,"line":103},{"w":"reaching","s":284.88,"e":285.48,"line":103},{"w":"for","s":285.48,"e":285.7,"line":103},{"w":"the","s":285.7,"e":285.93,"line":103},{"w":"light","s":285.93,"e":286.3,"line":103}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":3.31,"text":"First memory, Bush on the screen,"},{"s":3.31,"e":6.12,"text":"Talking New World Order, what could it mean?"},{"s":6.12,"e":9.19,"text":"One of my first words was \"checkbook,\" they say,"},{"s":9.19,"e":12.39,"text":"I was asking big questions from my very first day."},{"s":12.39,"e":14.63,"text":"I learned to cook when I was young,"},{"s":14.63,"e":17.38,"text":"Loved electricity and how things were done."},{"s":17.38,"e":19.62,"text":"Copper wire wrapped around a screw,"},{"s":19.62,"e":22.24,"text":"Add a battery, watch what magnets can do."},{"s":22.24,"e":24.61,"text":"Years at Rutgers, partying all night,"},{"s":24.61,"e":27.74,"text":"Then I found a laboratory, studying things right."},{"s":27.74,"e":30.23,"text":"Working with ultrasound, testing pills,"},{"s":30.23,"e":32.92,"text":"Measuring tiny spaces hidden inside still."},{"s":32.92,"e":36.05,"text":"We sent sound through tablets, measured the time,"},{"s":36.05,"e":38.87,"text":"Two kinds of waves helped the numbers align."},{"s":38.87,"e":41.43,"text":"Four hundred volts made the system fire,"},{"s":41.43,"e":44.88,"text":"I was back to electricity, just like that copper wire."},{"s":44.88,"e":47.18,"text":"Iron washers, testing something new,"},{"s":47.18,"e":50.51,"text":"Then strange things happened I couldn't see through."},{"s":50.51,"e":53.58,"text":"Equipment stopped working, then came back again,"},{"s":53.58,"e":56.26,"text":"A computer resumed like it never had been."},{"s":56.26,"e":58.95,"text":"A bolt moved toward a screwdriver one day,"},{"s":58.95,"e":61.57,"text":"I got so scared, didn't know what to say."},{"s":61.57,"e":64.26,"text":"Was it just magnetism? Something I missed?"},{"s":64.26,"e":66.82,"text":"I wanted the answers, not another twist."},{"s":66.82,"e":69.76,"text":"I spent my life chasing things I couldn't see,"},{"s":69.76,"e":72.51,"text":"Trying to understand what they meant to me."},{"s":72.51,"e":74.75,"text":"Every time I thought I knew it all,"},{"s":74.75,"e":77.24,"text":"Another question made the heavens call."},{"s":77.24,"e":79.29,"text":"ABOVE THE GRAYS! ABOVE THE GODS!"},{"s":79.29,"e":82.1,"text":"In the world I dream, I'm beating every odd!"},{"s":82.1,"e":84.91,"text":"Higher than Olympus, farther than the stars,"},{"s":84.91,"e":87.86,"text":"I'll keep on rising, no matter where they are!"},{"s":87.86,"e":89.84,"text":"TIME OF FLIGHT! INTO THE LIGHT!"},{"s":89.84,"e":93.1,"text":"Sending all my questions through the endless night!"},{"s":93.1,"e":95.91,"text":"I don't need a throne, I don't need a crown,"},{"s":95.91,"e":98.98,"text":"I'm building myself up, they can't keep me down!"},{"s":98.98,"e":101.67,"text":"Then I started seeing patterns everywhere,"},{"s":101.67,"e":104.8,"text":"License plates and strangers, signals in the air."},{"s":104.8,"e":107.81,"text":"People's actions seemed connected to my dreams,"},{"s":107.81,"e":110.88,"text":"I feared they read my thoughts, or so it seemed."},{"s":110.88,"e":112.99,"text":"Went to the police, then the FBI,"},{"s":112.99,"e":115.74,"text":"Asked for some answers, needed to know why."},{"s":115.74,"e":118.55,"text":"Went for mental health care, then rehab too,"},{"s":118.55,"e":121.81,"text":"Looking for the truth and a way to make it through."},{"s":121.81,"e":124.56,"text":"Every day brought moments that felt divine,"},{"s":124.56,"e":127.25,"text":"Miracles and mysteries filling up my mind."},{"s":127.25,"e":130.77,"text":"Didn't know what they meant, didn't know what was real,"},{"s":130.77,"e":133.9,"text":"But I knew how powerful those moments could feel."},{"s":133.9,"e":137.23,"text":"Troll lords and mobsters became villains in my tale,"},{"s":137.23,"e":140.04,"text":"A battle in my head where I refused to fail."},{"s":140.04,"e":143.11,"text":"Found comfort in Jesus, but questioned his name,"},{"s":143.11,"e":146.37,"text":"Had some peace and anger burning in the same flame."},{"s":146.37,"e":149.38,"text":"Then I played a god with a wild sense of pride,"},{"s":149.38,"e":152.58,"text":"Said, \"Christ copied me!\" with a theatrical smile."},{"s":152.58,"e":155.52,"text":"Two thousand years apart, an impossible claim,"},{"s":155.52,"e":158.71,"text":"But I turned my strange story into music and fame."},{"s":158.71,"e":160.76,"text":"ABOVE THE GRAYS! ABOVE THE GODS!"},{"s":160.76,"e":163.58,"text":"In the world I dream, I'm beating every odd!"},{"s":163.58,"e":166.39,"text":"Higher than Olympus, farther than the stars,"},{"s":166.39,"e":169.33,"text":"I'll keep on rising, no matter where they are!"},{"s":169.33,"e":171.31,"text":"TIME OF FLIGHT! INTO THE LIGHT!"},{"s":171.31,"e":174.58,"text":"Sending all my questions through the endless night!"},{"s":174.58,"e":177.39,"text":"I don't need a throne, I don't need a crown,"},{"s":177.39,"e":180.46,"text":"I'm building myself up, they can't keep me down!"},{"s":180.46,"e":183.4,"text":"Now I'm coding all day, making websites shine,"},{"s":183.4,"e":186.21,"text":"Building new inventions, one idea at a time."},{"s":186.21,"e":189.03,"text":"Freestyling faster, trying to break my best,"},{"s":189.03,"e":192.1,"text":"Working on my body, putting muscles to the test."},{"s":192.1,"e":194.72,"text":"Zeus has lightning? I studied that spark!"},{"s":194.72,"e":197.41,"text":"Apollo has music? I can light up the dark!"},{"s":197.41,"e":199.96,"text":"Hermes has speed? Watch these words fly!"},{"s":199.96,"e":202.65,"text":"Even the Greek gods can watch me aim high!"},{"s":202.65,"e":205.85,"text":"Gray aliens in spaceships, kings of distant skies,"},{"s":205.85,"e":209.24,"text":"In my science-fiction story, I can match their minds."},{"s":209.24,"e":212.63,"text":"I can write a universe where I'm the greatest of all,"},{"s":212.63,"e":216.14,"text":"But in real life I'm human, still learning when I fall."},{"s":216.14,"e":218.83,"text":"Call myself a sex god, say it with a grin,"},{"s":218.83,"e":221.9,"text":"I'm my own competition, every day I want to win."},{"s":221.9,"e":224.71,"text":"Faster with the rhymes, stronger every year,"},{"s":224.71,"e":228.23,"text":"Building something beautiful while facing down my fear."},{"s":228.23,"e":231.43,"text":"After all the strange events and mysteries untold,"},{"s":231.43,"e":234.75,"text":"After all the dreams of power, all the stories bold,"},{"s":234.75,"e":237.38,"text":"I found myself at a Hindu temple one day,"},{"s":237.38,"e":240.25,"text":"With a thousand questions I couldn't explain."},{"s":240.25,"e":243.13,"text":"I came down from Olympus, had to face defeat,"},{"s":243.13,"e":246.65,"text":"Because after all that god talk, I still needed to eat."},{"s":246.65,"e":248.7,"text":"ABOVE THE GRAYS! ABOVE THE GODS!"},{"s":248.7,"e":251,"text":"My imagination goes beyond the odds!"},{"s":251,"e":254.26,"text":"Past a million galaxies, beyond the highest throne,"},{"s":254.26,"e":257.33,"text":"Every world I dream begins with what I've known!"},{"s":257.33,"e":259.31,"text":"TIME OF FLIGHT! INTO THE LIGHT!"},{"s":259.31,"e":262.45,"text":"I'm chasing understanding with everything inside!"},{"s":262.45,"e":266.03,"text":"Not a god above creation, just a man who dreams so high,"},{"s":266.03,"e":269.42,"text":"I can build a thousand worlds beneath an endless sky!"},{"s":269.42,"e":270.82,"text":"First word, checkbook."},{"s":270.82,"e":272.23,"text":"First magnet, a screw."},{"s":272.23,"e":273.83,"text":"Four hundred volts later,"},{"s":273.83,"e":275.88,"text":"Still searching for what's true."},{"s":275.88,"e":277.6,"text":"I challenged gods in music,"},{"s":277.6,"e":279.27,"text":"Made the stars feel small."},{"s":279.27,"e":281.31,"text":"But learning how to live my life"},{"s":281.31,"e":283.42,"text":"Might be the greatest win of all."},{"s":283.42,"e":284.51,"text":"Time of flight..."},{"s":284.51,"e":286.3,"text":"Still reaching for the light"}],"duration":286.8,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}